pij watch — subscribe this non-pi peer to file changes

USAGE
  pij watch [--diff | --mode notify|diff] [--debounce n[ms|s]] <glob...>
  pij unwatch [<glob...>]

MODES
  notify  (default)  changed-line ranges per file, e.g. "modified (+12/-3) lines 40-42"
