[31m+ pij tail <id> [--since N] [--follow]                 # peek its transcript without disturbing it[39m
[31m+ ```[39m
[31m+[39m
[31m+ **Remote controls on rs** ([full contract](../../../../docs/how/pij.md#remote-session-control)):[39m
[31m+ commands carry no body; OMP/Pi handles claims in-process and acknowledges `executed` or[39m
[31m+ `refused` + reason. Acceptance is NOT completion. Native extension delivery bypasses typing[39m
[31m+ grace; Claude PTY keeps it (human drafts hold commands). Copilot refuses with[39m
